{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "127", "x": 0.8965598059325655, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03718344267107032, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "programme has seen moderate success, mainly in areas with less subsidence.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12334338960510077, "w": 0.8259900604107785, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "'Unfortunately, traditional infrastructure is often single-solution focused,' says", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1436641300790535, "w": 0.8265258558193626, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Tol. 'For long-term success, it's critical that we transition towards multifunctional", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.16398487055300617, "w": 0.826204132514323, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "approaches that embed natural processes and that engage and benefit", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.18445393154231154, "w": 0.8260550612314908, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "communities and local decision-makers.'", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.20477467201626426, "w": 0.41637318898640036, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "D", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23503326423277177, "w": 0.02101269433220525, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "As the floodwaters rose in the rice fields of the Mekong Delta in September", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.23503326423277177, "w": 0.7657967373073851, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2018, four small houses rose with them. Homes in this part of Vietnam are", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.25550232522207716, "w": 0.8260772066215126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "traditionally built on stilts but these ones had been built to float. The modifications", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2758601835462605, "w": 0.8261859855974996, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "were made by the Buoyant Foundation Project, a not-for-profit organisation that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.29618092402021323, "w": 0.8265752728470964, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "has been researching and retrofitting amphibious houses since 2006. 'When I", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.31664996614882235, "w": 0.8260771040965588, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "started this,' explains founder Elizabeth English, 'climate change was not on the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33697070662277506, "w": 0.825924649490251, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "tip of everybody's tongue, but this technology is becoming necessary in places", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3572914470967278, "w": 0.8263094256418806, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that didn't previously need it.' It's much cheaper than permanently elevating", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3777605080860331, "w": 0.8260772066215126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "houses, English explains - about a third of what it would cost to completely", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.39808124855998583, "w": 0.8262384783738476, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "replace a building's foundations. It also avoids the problem of taller houses being", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.41840198903393855, "w": 0.826588088466322, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "at greater risk from wind damage. Another plus comes from the fact that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.43887105002324395, "w": 0.8261641477823392, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "amphibious structures can be sensitively adapted to meet cultural needs and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4591917904971966, "w": 0.8259248545401586, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "match the kind of houses that are already common in a community.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4796855589985966, "w": 0.6833052620009816, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "E", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5099441889364966, "w": 0.01919854090586743, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Bangladesh is especially vulnerable to climate change. Most of the country", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.5099441889364966, "w": 0.765853536131793, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "is less than a metre above sea level and 80 per cent of its land lies on floodplains.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5302649294104493, "w": 0.8262514990429808, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "'Almost 35 million people living on the coastal belt of Bangladesh are currently", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5505856321630095, "w": 0.8259901629357324, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "affected by soil and water salinity,' says Raisa Chowdhury of the international", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5710547308737074, "w": 0.8260212279967352, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "development organisation ICCO Cooperation. Rather than fighting against it, one", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5913754336262677, "w": 0.8260116931760313, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "project is helping communities adapt to salt-affected soils. ICCO Cooperation has", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6116961741002203, "w": 0.826533955290713, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "been working with 10,000 farmers in Bangladesh to start cultivating naturally", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6321652728109182, "w": 0.7899369553554063, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "salt-tolerant crops in the region. Certain varieties of carrot, potato, kohlrabi,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6624609828776564, "w": 0.8261181140780808, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cabbage and beetroot have been found to be better suited to salty soil than the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6827816479088241, "w": 0.8258814864846993, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "rice and wheat that is typically grown there. Chowdhury says that the results are", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7032507843409145, "w": 0.8264986867066042, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "very visible, comparing a barren plot of land to the 'beautiful, lush green vegetable", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7235714493720822, "w": 0.8262297637527742, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "garden' sitting beside it, in which he and his team have been working with the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7438922652888199, "w": 0.8258593410946774, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "farmers. Since the project began, farmers trained in saline agriculture have", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7643612508353402, "w": 0.8266432468914691, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "reported increases of two to three more harvests per year.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.784682066752078, "w": 0.5961756603094018, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "F", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8149406589685855, "w": 0.01859382309708816, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Greg Spotts from Los Angeles (LA) in the USA is chief sustainability officer", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.8149406589685855, "w": 0.7656877532814905, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of the city's street services department. He leads the Cool Streets LA programme,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8352613994425382, "w": 0.8261859855974996, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a series of pilot projects, which include the planting of trees and the installation", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8557552056653307, "w": 0.82598093568989, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of a 'cool pavement' system, designed to help reach the city's goal of bringing", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8760758706964984, "w": 0.825924649490251, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "down its average temperature by 1.5°C. 'Urban cooling is literally a matter of life", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8965450071285888, "w": 0.8260116931760313, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and death for our future in LA,' says Spotts. Using a Geographic Information", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9168656721597565, "w": 0.8261796290503637, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "System data mapping tool, the programme identified streets with low tree canopy", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9371864126337092, "w": 0.8262296612278204, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}